_{ij} & =k{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying these rules to the given sum, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{40}5({a}_{ij}-{b}_{ij}) & =5{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{40}({a}_{ij}-{b}_{ij}) \\\\  & =5{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{40}{a}_{ij}-5{\\sum }_{i=1}^{30}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{40}{b}_{ij} \\\\  & =5\\cdot 220-5\\cdot 200 \\\\  & =1,100-1,000 \\\\  & =100.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533403 17592186045585 true] [17592186275229 1068 #edb/ref 17592186274856 13194139533403 17592186045585 true] [17592186275229 1069 "q-149658" 13194139533403 17592186045585 true] [17592186275229 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533403 17592186045585 true] [17592186275229 1071 "Find the value of the double sum\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}(3{a}_{ij}+4{b}_{ij})\n$$\n\ngiven that\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}{a}_{ij}=50,\\,{\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}{b}_{ij}=55.\n$$" 13194139533403 17592186045585 true] [17592186275229 1072 #uuid "ef4c6fb1-0d43-563d-bfcd-a6f487b03463" 13194139533403 17592186045585 true] [17592186275229 1074 "The sum and constant multiple rules for double summations state that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({a}_{ij}+{b}_{ij}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}+{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{b}_{ij}, \\\\ {\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}k{a}_{ij} & =k{\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{a}_{ij}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying these rules to the given sum, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}(3{a}_{ij}+4{b}_{ij}) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}3{a}_{ij}+{\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}4{b}_{ij} \\\\  & =3{\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}{a}_{ij}+4{\\sum }_{i=1}^{25}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{70}{b}_{ij} \\\\  & =3\\cdot 50+4\\cdot 55 \\\\  & =150+220 \\\\  & =370.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533403 17592186045585 true] [17592186275230 1068 #edb/ref 1759218627476